# separators — шаги записи (что показывается — separators.md)
# Его замечание 2026-10-05: подробнее про Left/Right Block; Mark/Dim ticked line — отдельный GIF (ticked-line).
title Separators | Your text in the middle, tags on the left and right
open Separators.md
caret - call the bank
stage Left Block
say Left Block: tags go before your text
cmd status-next
expect - #todo || call the bank
cmd priority-next
expect - #todo #low || call the bank
say The First Separator || ends the Left Block
pause 2200

stage Right Block
say Right Block: links and dates go after your text
caret - #todo #low || call the bank
cmd project-next
expect - #todo #low || call the bank || [[Project A]]
say The Second Separator || starts the Right Block
pause 2200

stage First Separator
say First Separator → ::
settings Tags & PKM
click ▸
set First Separator = ::
caret - call the bank
cmd status-next
cmd project-next
expect - #todo :: call the bank || [[Project A]]

stage Second Separator
say Second Separator → ::
settings Tags & PKM
set Second Separator = ::
caret - call the bank
cmd status-next
cmd project-next
expect - #todo :: call the bank :: [[Project A]]
